## 1. Purpose and scope

This document assesses the **process risk** of using {{tool_name}} ({{vendor}}) for the contexts of use defined in {{doc_id_01}}, links each AI-specific failure mode to the controlling requirement ({{doc_id_02}}) and to the test that proves it ({{doc_id_05}}), determines the criticality and the resulting assurance level, test depth and review cadence, and justifies the model policy.

Process risk is not device risk. Where an AI-assisted change could affect a risk control of the device, the device risk management file is updated under the normal design-change process: [fill in: reference to the risk management procedure / file].

